title: Make native shell acceptance portable to hosted Fish
description: PR 1279 CI exposed Fish 3.7 stdin invocation incompatibility in the new native acceptance harness and a prose-reference graph gap introduced by the final validation evidence comment. Preserve all assertions and graph budgets while fixing the harness transport and recording the actual historical-evidence relationship.
